  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Atlante da esplorare, confronto da degustazione",
    "overview": "EduBeer is a calm, approachable atlas whose identity comes from consulting beer styles. Porcelain backgrounds, espresso text and petrol selections hold together humanist headings, geometric beer glasses and exact numerical intervals. Open lists invite exploration; the comparison surface increases information density within the same visual language.\n\nThe interface distinguishes Italian introductions, official English BJCP descriptions and curated beer content. Source captions and explicit units belong beside the information they explain. The shipping visual vocabulary uses SVG geometry and locally hosted fonts, with no raster imagery.",
